NAME
    modelkit - Command-line interface for the Modelkit framework

SYNOPSIS
    modelkit [global options] command [command options] [arguments...]

VERSION
    0.8.1

GLOBAL OPTIONS
    -g, --gems=constraints - Apply gem version constraints (default: none)
    --help                 - Show this message
    -i, --ignore-config    - Ignore all config files
    --load-paths=paths     - Load paths for Ruby require (default: none)
    --version              - Display the program version

COMMANDS
    config           - Show config file paths in effect for current directory
    console          - Start interactive Ruby console session
    help             - Show a list of commands or help for one command
    rake             - Execute Rake tasks in Modelkit environment
    ruby             - Execute Ruby script in Modelkit environment
    template-compose - Compose a template with parameter values and files
